      "parentCode": "82802D0000000000",
      "sourceID": "src.mext-82v12",
      "subject": "音楽",
      "text": "２　内　容"
    },
    {
      "code": "82802D3100000000",
      "frameworkID": "fw.cross-music",
      "locator": "CSV record 2732; No 2730",
      "parentCode": "82802D3000000000",
      "sourceID": "src.mext-82v12",
      "subject": "音楽",
      "text": "Ａ　表　現"
    },
    {
      "code": "82802D3120000000",
      "frameworkID": "fw.cross-music",
      "locator": "CSV record 2740; No 2738",
      "parentCode": "82802D3100000000",
      "sourceID": "src.mext-82v12",
      "subject": "音楽",
      "text": "(2) 器楽の活動を通して，次の事項を身に付けることができるよう指導する。"
    },
    {
      "code": "82802D3123000000",
      "frameworkID": "fw.cross-music",
      "locator": "CSV record 2745; No 2743",
      "parentCode": "82802D3120000000",
      "sourceID": "src.mext-82v12",
      "subject": "音楽",
      "text": "ウ　思いや意図に合った表現をするために必要な次の(ｱ)から(ｳ)までの技能を身に付けること。"
    },
    {
      "code": "82802D3123300000",
